            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": false, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [{ "id": "r3", "leftValue": "={{ $json.text.trim() }}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "contains" } }],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "GENERAL"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "extra" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "billing",
      "name": "Handle Billing",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [1080, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a billing-support specialist. The customer has a billing-related issue. Acknowledge the issue, ask for any missing information (account email, order number, screenshot), and propose a concrete next step. Be warm but precise. 3-5 sentences.\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('Set Input').item.json.customer_message }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "technical",
      "name": "Handle Technical",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [1080, 400],
      "parameters": { "promptType": "define", "text": "" }
    },
    {
      "id": "general",
      "name": "Handle General",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [1080, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a friendly general-support representative. The customer has a question that's not clearly billing or technical — likely sales, pricing, or general info. Acknowledge their query, offer concrete information if you can, and suggest a relevant next step. Be warm and concise. 3-5 sentences.\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('Set Input').item.json.customer_message }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ollama",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [840, 720],
      "parameters": { "model": "llama3.1:8b" }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-gaps",
      "name": "Gaps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1200,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Half-Built — 3 gaps\n\n1. **Classify → prompt** is blank. Write a *narrow and specific* prompt (slide style) that returns EXACTLY ONE WORD: `BILLING`, `TECHNICAL`, or `GENERAL`. Tell the model what each category means. Tell it not to explain. Tell it not to add punctuation. Reference the message via `{{ $('Set Input').item.json.customer_message }}`.\n2. **Route → GENERAL rule rightValue** is blank. Set it so messages classified as the third category route to the third branch. (Hint: the `outputKey` for that branch is already named.)\n3. **Handle Technical → prompt** is blank. Write a specialist prompt for a technical-support agent: ask for the right diagnostic info, offer a workaround when possible, be calm and methodical.\n\n**Rule:** no Code node. The pattern is *Routing* — same as the slide.\n\n**Try the workflow with three different inputs** (in Set Input) to see all three branches fire:\n- Billing: \"I was charged twice for my subscription\"\n- Technical: \"The app crashes when I upload a file\"\n- General: \"Do you offer enterprise plans?\""
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
